# Agent orientation (Cursor)

This repository uses the **AI-agent methodology** (plan → agree → implement; verify at the consumer-visible contract; human owns external actions).

## Read first every session

1. Always-applied rules under `.cursor/rules/` (gates + tool order).
2. Live snapshot: `data/changes/STATUS.md`.
3. Danger zones: `data/changes/SHARP_EDGES.md`.
4. Full pack: `data/changes/ai-agent-methodology/CURSOR_ADAPTATION.md`.

## Do not load by default

Per-ticket writeups, playbooks, and long history under `data/changes/<id>/` — open on demand only.

## Output contract

Define here (one paragraph): what downstream consumers actually observe (API JSON, UI field, event, artifact). All bugs are reproduced and verified against that surface.
